ppu_loader: ppu_load_elf_image(data, size), the ELF loader over bytes already in host memory; ppu_load_elf(path)
reads the file and calls it. KZ3's release build links the player's own EBOOT.elf into kz3.exe (step 9s) and loads
it from there. Upstream candidate (general: no KZ3 names).

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.15.0 (SPU pass 81): context only, upstream PR263 image ranges added next to it.

